@startuml
!include _estilo.iuml
title Diagrama de Implantação

node "Computador da confeitaria (Windows 10 / 11)" as PC {
  node "Navegador (Chrome / Edge / Firefox)" as NAV {
    artifact "Telas HTML/CSS/JS\n(localhost:5500)" as TELAS
    artifact "Swagger UI\n(localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html)" as SWG
  }
  node "Java 17 - processo 1" as J1 {
    artifact "ServidorFrontend.java\nporta 5500" as SF
  }
  node "Java 17 - processo 2" as J2 {
    artifact "API ConfeitaSys (Spring Boot)\nTomcat embutido, porta 8080" as API
    artifact "postgresql JDBC driver" as DRV
  }
  node "Serviço do Windows: PostgreSQL" as PGN {
    database "banco confeitasys\nporta 5432" as DB
  }
  folder "backend/backup/  backend/relatorios/" as PASTAS
  artifact "INICIAR-SISTEMA.bat\n(banco → API → telas)" as BAT
}

BAT ..> PGN : iniciar-banco.bat
BAT ..> J2 : iniciar-backend.bat
BAT ..> J1 : iniciar-frontend.bat
SF --> TELAS : arquivos estáticos
TELAS --> API : HTTP/JSON + token
SWG --> API : HTTP/JSON + token
API --> DRV
DRV --> DB : JDBC (TCP 5432)
API --> PASTAS
note bottom of PC
  As três partes são separadas e independentes:
  o banco (PostgreSQL) precisa estar ligado para a API funcionar,
  e a API precisa estar ligada para as telas funcionarem.
end note
@enduml
